# Table views include sort

When you create or add a table view (dashboard, account, or cards/table toggle), wire column sort in that same change. Do not ship a header-only table.

- Use `useTableSort`, `SortableTh`, and `compareValues` from `@/components/ui/SortableTh`.
- Make every data column sortable. Leave Actions / menus as a plain `<th>`.
- Pick a sensible default sort (dates and money: desc first).
- Sort the rendered rows with `useMemo` so grid/mobile fallbacks can reuse the same order.
